an%20be%20seamlessly%20deployed%20to%20hardware%20without%20further%20finetuning.%20Videos%20and%20code%20available%20on%20our%20website.%22%2C%22DOI%22%3A%2210.48550%2FarXiv.2603.25464%22%2C%22language%22%3A%22en%22%2C%22note%22%3A%22arXiv%3A2603.25464%20%5Bcs.LG%5D%22%2C%22number%22%3A%22arXiv%3A2603.25464%22%2C%22publisher%22%3A%22arXiv%22%2C%22source%22%3A%22arXiv.org%22%2C%22title%22%3A%22Maximum%20Entropy%20Behavior%20Exploration%20for%20Sim2Real%20Zero-Shot%20Reinforcement%20Learning%22%2C%22URL%22%3A%22http%3A%2F%2Farxiv.org%2Fabs%2F2603.25464%22%2C%22author%22%3A%5B%7B%22family%22%3A%22Hu%22%2C%22given%22%3A%22Jiajun%22%7D%2C%7B%22family%22%3A%22Urpi%22%2C%22given%22%3A%22Nuria%20Armengol%22%7D%2C%7B%22family%22%3A%22Cheng%22%2C%22given%22%3A%22Jin%22%7D%2C%7B%22family%22%3A%22Coros%22%2C%22given%22%3A%22Stelian%22%7D%5D%2C%22accessed%22%3A%7B%22date-parts%22%3A%5B%5B%222026%22%2C7%2C22%5D%5D%7D%2C%22issued%22%3A%7B%22date-parts%22%3A%5B%5B%222026%22%2C3%2C26%5D%5D%7D%7D%7D%5D\" data-schema-version=\"9\"><p>Maximum Entropy Behavior Exploration for Sim2Real Zero-shot RL:</p>\n<p>Zero-shot rl for robotic manipulation: BFM</p>\n<p>Quadrupedal Control - online zero-shot RL, FB-MEBE (Directed FB)</p>\n<p>Limitations of Regularized Undirected Exploration</p>\n<p style=\"padding-left: 40px;\" data-indent=\"1\">a.Finite d and Insufficient data distributions - FB representation collapse</p>\n<p style=\"padding-left: 40px;\" data-indent=\"1\">b. undirected exploration strategy - performance degradation and entropy stagnation</p>\n<p style=\"padding-left: 40px;\" data-indent=\"1\">-ground the unsupervised policy learning by adding a regularizer</p>\n<p style=\"padding-left: 40px;\" data-indent=\"1\"><img alt=\"\" width=\"653\" height=\"59\" data-attachment-key=\"8GGI6QLV\" src=\"assets/note-images/8GGI6QLV/image.png\"></p>\n<p style=\"padding-left: 40px;\" data-indent=\"1\">Qreg - Sections F and G</p>\n<p style=\"padding-left: 80px;\" data-indent=\"2\">a. Less foot dragging</p>\n<p style=\"padding-left: 80px;\" data-indent=\"2\">b. lower exploration - poorer entropy and performance</p>\n<p style=\"padding-left: 40px;\" data-indent=\"1\">FB-MEBE</p>\n<p style=\"padding-left: 80px;\" data-indent=\"2\">1.density-inverse exploration for online FB</p>\n<p style=\"padding-left: 120px;\" data-indent=\"3\"><img alt=\"\" width=\"312\" height=\"55\" data-attachment-key=\"NBCSNC6E\" src=\"assets/note-images/NBCSNC6E/image.png\"></p>\n<p style=\"padding-left: 120px;\" data-indent=\"3\">-&gt; no access to the desired behavior distribution:</p>\n<p style=\"padding-left: 120px;\" data-indent=\"3\"><img alt=\"\" width=\"261\" height=\"55\" data-attachment-key=\"84FGHBA3\" src=\"assets/note-images/84FGHBA3/image.png\"></p>\n<p style=\"padding-left: 240px;\" data-indent=\"6\">optimizing policy:</p>\n<p style=\"padding-left: 240px;\" data-indent=\"6\"><img alt=\"\" width=\"422\" height=\"71\" data-attachment-key=\"4UEYGGSA\" src=\"assets/note-images/4UEYGGSA/image.png\"></p>\n<p><span class=\"highlight\" data-annotation=\"%7B%22attachmentURI%22%3A%22http%3A%2F%2Fzotero.org%2Fusers%2F19922179%2Fitems%2FQ4S2CIR2%22%2C%22pageLabel%22%3A%226%22%2C%22position%22%3A%7B%22pageIndex%22%3A5%2C%22rects%22%3A%5B%5B241.34940099999992%2C412.35150940000045%2C503.75432239999935%2C424.35644240000045%5D%2C%5B107.99999999999986%2C398.98855000000043%2C503.11892605999986%2C412.40044240000043%5D%2C%5B107.99999999999989%2C388.4405094000004%2C315.01286539999995%2C400.4454424000004%5D%5D%7D%2C%22citationItem%22%3A%7B%22uris%22%3A%5B%22http%3A%2F%2Fzotero.org%2Fusers%2F19922179%2Fitems%2FBV77JN4T%22%5D%2C%22locator%22%3A%226%22%7D%7D\">“Consequently, rather than predicting future outcomes, FB-MEBE steers the achieved behavior distribution towards uniformity by sampling exploration behaviors zrE that have the minimum density in the current buffer.”</span> </p>\n<p style=\"padding-left: 80px;\" data-indent=\"2\">2. pratical FB-MEBE</p>\n<p style=\"padding-left: 80px;\" data